</head>
<body>

<h1>Event-Driven Microservice Architecture &mdash; Message Flow Panorama</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Producer Services &rarr; Kafka Topic Routing Hub &rarr; Consumer Services &bull; Schema Registry Validation &bull; DLQ Error Paths &bull; Monitoring Pipeline</p>

<div id="diagram"></div>

<div class="legend">
  <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-line legend-line--produce"></span> Produce (avro async)</div>
  <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-line legend-line--consume"></span> Consume (consumer groups)</div>
  <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-line legend-line--dlq"></span> DLQ Error Path (max-retries)</div>
  <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-line legend-line--schema"></span> Schema Lookup (sync HTTP)</div>
  <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-line legend-line--monitor"></span> Metrics / Alerting</div>
  <div class="legend-item" style="color:#16a34a;">&#x25A0; Producer</div>
  <div class="legend-item" style="color:#b45309;">&#x25A0; Producer-Consumer</div>
  <div class="legend-item" style="color:#2563eb;">&#x25A0; Consumer</div>
